  "body": "From some profiling of matrix.org, it seems that the overhead of replication (using Redis) is ~20 - 25% per process. This figure was gather via profiling (via py-spy) a worker that had no traffic going to it.\r\n\r\nWe should investigate what's going on here!\r\n\r\nSpun out of #7670",
